- Minor spoiler follows-




















     Firstly, spells memorized don't last forever. You need to refresh your
memory of the sell by re-reading the spellbook. There is always a chance that
you can't successfully learn the spell. The higher your intelligence is, the
greater chance you have. Consequently, the higher the spell level, the
harder it is to memorize, and you will not remember it as long. Any
class can learn a spell, it only has to do with your intelligence.
